resolution.description:
**What I did**
fixes https://github.com/Azure/sonic-buildimage/issues/6997
Added process for writing static routes to config_db.

fixes https://github.com/Azure/sonic-buildimage/issues/7261
Added interface validation before creating route.

**How I did it**
Refactored add/del route functions. Wrote generic function that returns a vtysh command and an entry for config_db with name.
```
sudo config route add prefix <IP>/32 nexthop <IP>
sudo config route add prefix <IP>/32 nexthop <IP>
sudo config route add prefix <IP>/32 nexthop <IP>
sudo config route add prefix vrf Vrf-RED <IP>/32 nexthop <IP>
sudo config save -y
sudo reboot
```
Instead of running the vtysh command, it creates config_db entries that will be loaded by the ffr daemon:
```
    "STATIC_ROUTE": {
        "<IP>/32": {
            "nexthop": "<IP>"
        },
        "<IP>/32": {
            "nexthop": "<IP>"
        },
        "<IP>/32": {
            "nexthop": "<IP>"
        },
        "Vrf-RED|<IP>/32": {
            "nexthop": "<IP>"
        }
    }
```
